  "observations": [
    "The front input-return region surrounds the regulator and reaches its exposed pad; the separate output-return region contacts GND pin 4 and both output-capacitor ground pads.",
    "Four thermal vias lie outside SMD lands, paired on either side of the exposed pad and tied by short 0.6mm front straps.",
    "The back ground region flanks the feedback and trim routes; the added In1 region covers the feedback trace projection except the two FB via antipads.",
    "The extended In1 AUX reference enters a small U20 edge recess without joining the buck plane. Native checks preserve all U20 direct ground-via contacts and its sense reference.",
    "The other three earlier planes and all ordinary prior copper and component placements are unchanged. Wide portions of the board remain unrouted.",
    "Copper area and geometry alone do not qualify regulator dissipation, load, capacitor derating, startup, complete shielding performance or installed fit."
  ],
